Hi Ash,

You can just put the prefix in the argument for 'spatial', e.g.
micro<-micro_era5(loc = loc, dstart = dstart, dfinish = dfinish, spatial = "C:/Users/ash/era5_data/era5"))
and it should work.

Good point about the request_era5 - the way I've written micro_era5 it is expecting separate files for each year. You could suggest to Dave Klinges to make the combine = FALSE the default.

All the best,
Mike

