Hi Mike and Ash,

Just catching up on this thread– I made combine = TRUE the default in response to requests by others who wanted this behavior, but given that filing in to micro_era5 is an important use case of the `mcera5` package I think this raises a good point. I'm making a note to update that ASAP.

Best,
Dave
